  "details": "When loading into a new world its can be very boring seeing the teal background and tips, with nothing happening. For some this is fine but for others it would be nice to have animations occur around you. I'm thinking of having preset avatar animations occur around the player during loading. This can be from running around you, waving at you, or maybe them showing stickers to each other etc. Thinking about it profit wise, normal Vrchat users are forced to use preset animations with preset avatars. While Vrchat+ users could use avatars they have saved and even allow for custom animations made by others or themselves. This could give some a nice viewing during loading screens and it would be completely optional as well as profitable.",
